<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>GovTech Contracts &amp; Procurement Intelligence | J.E. Rocker</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/src/styles/dashboard.css">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: #0b0f17;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    }
    .govtech-landing-wrap {
      max-width: 1240px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 20px 80px;
    }
    .hero-banner {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 50px 24px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.4), rgba(11, 15, 23, 0.95));
      border: 1px solid #1e293b;
      border-radius: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }
    .hero-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 14px;
      background: #1e3a8a;
      color: #93c5fd;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .hero-banner h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: #f8fafc;
      font-weight: 800;
    }
    .hero-banner p {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: #94a3b8;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      background: #0284c7;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.3);
    }
    .cta-button:hover {
      background: #0369a1;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
    .nav-links-sub {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .nav-links-sub a {
      color: #38bdf8;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 10px;
    }
    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 56px;
    }
    .feature-card {
      background: #111827;
      border: 1px solid #1f2937;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    .feature-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: #38bdf8;
    }
    .feature-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .pricing-heading {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .pricing-heading h2 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      color: #f8fafc;
      margin: 0 0 8px;
    }
    .pricing-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }
    .price-card {
      background: #111827;
      border: 1px solid #1f2937;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 24px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .price-card:hover {
      border-color: #38bdf8;
    }
    .price-name {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .price-val {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #34d399;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .price-desc {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: #94a3b8;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }
    .price-btn {
      display: block;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #1e293b;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
      color: #f8fafc;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .price-btn:hover {
      background: #0284c7;
      border-color: #0284c7;
    }
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .pricing-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
      .features-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .pricing-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="govtech-landing-wrap">
    <header class="hero-banner">
      <span class="hero-tag">Business 1 &bull; GovTech Contracts</span>
      <h1>GovTech Capture &amp; Intelligence</h1>
      <p>Autonomous opportunity discovery, SAM.gov registration audits, and targeted proposal alignment for defense contractors and small businesses.</p>
      <a href="/govtech-intake" class="cta-button">Begin Client Onboarding &rarr;</a>
      <div class="nav-links-sub">
        <a href="/cover">&larr; Return to GovTech Cover</a>
        <a href="/business-driver">Business Driver Cockpit</a>
        <a href="/govtech-dashboard">GovTech Operations Dashboard</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="features-grid">
      <article class="feature-card">
        <h3>🏛️ Automated Procurement Ingestion</h3>
        <p>Continuous pipeline scraping across SAM.gov and 6 key state databases (AZ, CA, TX, FL, VA, NY) tracking over 63,000+ solicitations.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <h3>📊 Grant Neural Engine (GNE)</h3>
        <p>Predictive agency budget cycle intelligence and modernization signals mapping requirements directly to your NAICS and PSC codes.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <h3>📑 Proposal &amp; Readiness Support</h3>
        <p>Full-cycle compliance matrix construction, technical proposal reviews, and formal capability statement positioning.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing-section">
      <div class="pricing-heading">
        <h2>Commercial Services &amp; Pricing</h2>
        <p style="color: #94a3b8; margin: 0;">Select the tier that aligns with your contract pursuit posture.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <div class="price-card">
          <div>
            <div class="price-name">Readiness Package</div>
            <div class="price-val">$499</div>
            <div class="price-desc">One-time comprehensive SAM.gov registration audit, UEI verification, and formal capability statement optimization.</div>
          </div>
          <a href="/govtech-checkout/readiness" class="price-btn">Authorize $499 &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="price-card">
          <div>
            <div class="price-name">Intelligence Subscription</div>
            <div class="price-val">$149<span style="font-size:1rem;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:400">/mo</span></div>
            <div class="price-desc">Continuous automated opportunity alerts, weekly state/federal pipeline matching, and agency cycle trends.</div>
          </div>
          <a href="/govtech-checkout/intel" class="price-btn">Subscribe $149/mo &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="price-card">
          <div>
            <div class="price-name">Proposal Support</div>
            <div class="price-val">$399</div>
            <div class="price-desc">Per-proposal compliance matrix review, RFP technical requirement mapping, and executive proposal packaging.</div>
          </div>
          <a href="/govtech-checkout/proposal" class="price-btn">Authorize $399 &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="price-card">
          <div>
            <div class="price-name">GovTech Retainer</div>
            <div class="price-val">$999<span style="font-size:1rem;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:400">/mo</span></div>
            <div class="price-desc">Dedicated executive contracting partnership: proactive capture defense, custom agency briefing, and priority proposal assembly.</div>
          </div>
          <a href="/govtech-checkout/retainer" class="price-btn">Retain $999/mo &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
